# Loaded by `vite dev` only (mode=development), for all three apps — each vite
# config sets `envDir` to this directory so one file serves the whole workspace.
#
# Tracked on purpose. Nothing here is a real credential: the local mock identity
# provider accepts any client_id/secret pair, so this value only has to be
# present. It lives here rather than as a literal in `personaRoster.ts` because a
# literal survives tree-shaking inside `dist/**.map` via sourcesContent, and a
# published sourcemap is a published file.
#
# A production build loads none of this, which is correct — the persona switcher
# is disabled there and never reads it.
VITE_PERSONA_SECRET=dev-secret
